    "UIName": "Shadow Hawk SHD-5D",
    "Id": "mechdef_shadowhawk_SHD-5D",
    "Name": "Shadow Hawk SHD-5D",
    "Details": "The 5D is a Davion upgrade to the original, part of Kallon Industries' participation in the \"Project Phoenix\" initiative started by Vicore Industries. Imagined as a cavalry unit, the 5D removes the LRM-5 launcher and utilizes a RAC/5 in place of the original while also carrying two medium lasers, one in each arm, and a Streak SRM-4 mounted in the head. Two tons of autocannon ammo and one ton of Streak reloads are carried in the left torso, protected by CASE, while the nine and a half tons of armor are updated to ferro-fibrous. This model's jumping distance is also increased to 150 meters with five jump jets split between the rear torso areas.The use of an endo steel chassis frees enough weight to make these update possible.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_shadowhawk"
  },
